WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.879
Your personal access card works without email.

00:00:02.879 --> 00:00:06.049
Choose your password and keep your sign-in ID safe.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.731
Switch between week and month to find available times.

00:00:09.731 --> 00:00:13.620
Choose an upcoming day. Occupied times stay protected.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.826
Choose an available time and your washing machine.

00:00:16.826 --> 00:00:20.402
Add drying if needed. Review the summary and book.

00:00:20.402 --> 00:00:23.223
Your completed package appears in My Bookings.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.428
My Bookings shows the appointments for your apartment.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:33.118
You can cancel a future booking. The time then becomes available again.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:37.751
Finished washing early? Choose Release early on your current booking.

00:00:37.751 --> 00:00:40.004
Someone else can then use the machine.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:44.771
Email is optional. You can save your settings without an address.

00:00:44.771 --> 00:00:50.297
Choose notification filters. Set up push separately on each device in App and Device.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.914
Report a problem with the affected machine or room.

00:00:53.914 --> 00:00:58.593
Describe only what you observed. Status notifications are optional.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.979
Open the household QR invitation in your profile. The code works once, for ten minutes.

00:01:04.979 --> 00:01:09.902
No account yet? Leave the ID empty and choose your own password.

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:14.523
Already registered? Sign in with your resident ID and password.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:20.370
In App and Device, subscribe to your apartment calendar. Keep the address private.

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:25.177
Help contains the rules and introduction. Sign out on shared devices.
